      "writtenOn": "2025-02-21T17:25:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Assuming everything in the bundle still parses (which I believe is true since I can run the benchmark function without any failures from mustParse), I think this should be fine. I\u0027d be shocked if Mozilla added any new roots with a negative serial (in violation of various specifications).",
